<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>卷五书集 - 分类 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%BA%94%E4%B9%A6%E9%9B%86/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.161.0 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Tue, 16 Jun 2026 13:47:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%BA%94%E4%B9%A6%E9%9B%86/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>近治法：论猝倒 心伤暴亡 腹痛欲死 中恶 中痰 心疼</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/5-4-jinzhifa/</link><pubDate>Tue, 16 Jun 2026 13:45:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/5-4-jinzhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%BA%94%E4%B9%A6%E9%9B%86/">卷五书集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“近治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;猝倒、心痛暴亡、腹痛欲死、中恶中痰&lt;/strong&gt;等顷刻可毙之急症的急救法则。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;一时猝来之病，如风雨骤至，不可须臾迟缓。当辨寒热虚实，急用峻剂，或补气祛痰，或泻火散寒，或温肾回阳，下喉即愈&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item><item><title>远治法：论中风 臌胀 痿症 食炭</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/5-3-yuanzhifa/</link><pubDate>Tue, 16 Jun 2026 10:15:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/5-3-yuanzhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%BA%94%E4%B9%A6%E9%9B%86/">卷五书集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“远治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;中风、臌胀、痿症、癫痫食炭&lt;/strong&gt;等经年累月、卧床日久之顽症的远期调治法则。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;病得之年远，非旦夕可效，然大剂峻补、攻逐或化痰开窍，配合特殊护理与服药方法，亦可起沉疴于垂危&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item><item><title>暂治法：论伤风 伤食 伤暑 伤湿</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/5-2-zanzhifa/</link><pubDate>Mon, 15 Jun 2026 16:13:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/5-2-zanzhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%BA%94%E4%B9%A6%E9%9B%86/">卷五书集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“暂治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;平素体健无病之人，一朝感邪，用药暂攻其邪而愈&lt;/strong&gt;的法则。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;强壮之人腠理致密，正气充足，感邪后邪气虽盛而正能敌之，故可暂用重剂发散、攻消、清解，中病即止，不必虑其伤正&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item><item><title>久治法：论虚寒久治</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/5-1-jiuzhifa/</link><pubDate>Mon, 15 Jun 2026 09:03:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/5-1-jiuzhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%BA%94%E4%B9%A6%E9%9B%86/">卷五书集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“久治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;虚寒体质者须经年累月长期服药调养&lt;/strong&gt;的法则。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;寒虚之人，不可日断药饵。以温补脾胃、益气养血为基础，随症加减，缓缓图功，使气血渐充而虚寒自退&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item></channel></rss>